    crm:P183i_has_representation <https://ids.lib.harvard.edu/ids/iiif/493310030/full/full/0/default.jpg> ;
    rdf:value """bed-room, nor even the W.C.! He never sits decently on a chair, but lies at full length in it, with one foot resting on the toe of the other, he never puts on slippers, but puts his great dirty boots on all my delicate covered sofas, he eats like a perfect pig, and is always either cleaning his nails or scraping something off his face and wiping it on his coat, he always spills his food, and then  wipes it into the carpet with his feet , he is always talking that nonsensical Zionism and reading one his letters, and his breath is perfectly horrible.
On the other hand, he is perfectly good-natured, very, very kind, extremely witty, he is large-minded and sees the irony of things, and he """^^xsd:string ;
    mbdiaries-ontology:index 101 ;
    mbdiaries-ontology:part_of <https://mbdiaries.itatti.harvard.edu/resource/diary/1902-03> .

